{"id":"vod_lz_97070","vodId":"97070","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"鬼神童子","name_cn":"鬼神童子","date":"1995-01-01","year":"1995","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20241107-1/2c2ca4d0ae56e662170b56336100b80b.jpg"},"summary":"很久很久以前，人世间鬼怪横行，魑魅魍魉泛滥成灾。当时出现了一个最强的役小角，他降服了拥有强大实力的鬼神为自己所用，以铲除为非作歹的鬼怪。在役小角临死之际，他将鬼神封印，人世间绝少听闻鬼神的消息。时间来到了现代，役小角的后代小明（横山智佐 饰）在命运的驱使下解开封印，可是 高傲的前鬼根本不服从小明的役使，于是这个女孩只得将其变成童子的模样。与此同时，凭依兽大量出现，而许多可怕的敌人交替登场。人世间再度为难，小明能否继承祖先的遗志，和前鬼共同击退各路邪祟呢？　　本片根据谷菊秀（原作）、黒岩よしひろ（作画）创作的漫画《鬼神童子ZENKI》改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-07 15:16:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2328_cf993990/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2329_238f1f91/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2331_fc3d62d8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2330_4fd71e1d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2332_9ab3eb07/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2334_3b97c3a9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2333_8eb81397/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2336_2241fd1e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2335_d89b29e5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2337_4db1d80f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2338_ebbfcbad/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2339_b44030c6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2340_6a7f968d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2342_d87703c0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20241105/2341_a23969bd/index.m3u8"},{"n